qmanager_lpac
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Derived from: estkme-group/lpac v2.3.0  <https://github.com/estkme-group/lpac>
License:      GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 only (lpac, drivers);
              libeuicc is LGPL-2.1-only. Full AGPL text: dependencies/lpac-AGPL-3.0.txt

The bundled `dependencies/qmanager_lpac` is a MODIFIED, statically linked ARMv7
(musl) build of tag v2.3.0. The only change is `dependencies/lpac-stdio.patch`:
the stdio APDU driver's inverted success checks on `json_request()` are fixed so
the driver works. Built with LPAC_DYNAMIC_LIBEUICC=OFF, PCSC, AT and curl
backends off. The complete corresponding source is the v2.3.0 tag plus that
patch. lpac runs as a separate program; QManager talks to it over stdin/stdout.
